# Citation metadata, in Citation File Format 1.2.0.
# GitHub renders this as "Cite this repository".
#
# The published release has no DOI. `version` and `date-released` make a
# citation unambiguous about what it saw.
#
# `license` is the code license. Datasets minted from this repository carry
# CC-BY-4.0, which is recorded in LICENSE-DATASETS.md and written into every
# manifest. The format has one license field, so this is the one it holds.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: 'Mintmark human resources: synthetic Turkish workforce and payroll records'
abstract: 'Declaration-and-data pack producing synthetic Turkish employment records: employees,
  position history, leave, payroll, and free-text performance, recruiting, and request documents.
  Holds two boundaries: health stays at category granularity, and the criminal record surface
  stays procedural, recording that a document was requested rather than what it contained.
  Requires the Mintmark engine.'
type: dataset
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-23
authors:
